    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Understood. Alright, arthritis in your knees, that matches what I have here. Let me tell you where I've got to. This is probably knee osteoarthritis flare. Let's get an X-ray of the knee, for knee pain. The treatment will be paracetamol, 1 gram, four times a day, two weeks. You take it by mouth. That's for knee pain. Strengthen the thigh muscles and lose a little weight if you can.",
